   "message": "After a little break I've started working through the rest of genesis with a computational theology / observer theory lens.\n\nThis is a (very) rough cut of genesis 5 - process - all my notes / bullets - ask Claude to build out the mechanic to prose - not edited but wanted @Tim @Mechalucard views - pls note arguments / prose unedited so excuse the llm pls - will like all work be heavily adjusted but wanted a sense of resonance to the shape of the arguments",
